    "Resumes list: each resume with its title, paper size, and template; click to select, right-click to delete." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Resumes list: each resume with its title, paper size, and template; click to select, right-click to delete."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「简历」列表:每份简历显示标题、纸张和模板;点击选择,右键可删除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「履歷」列表:每份履歷顯示標題、紙張和範本;點擊選擇,右鍵可刪除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「履歷」列表:每份履歷顯示標題、紙張和範本;點擊選擇,右鍵可刪除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「履歷」列表:每份履歷顯示標題、紙張和範本;點擊選擇,右鍵可刪除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Toolbar: the Preview / Source switch, the paper size caption, and the Print, Export PDF, and Export PNG buttons." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Toolbar: the Preview / Source switch, the paper size caption, and the Print, Export PDF, and Export PNG buttons."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "工具栏:「预览 / 源码」切换、纸张规格说明,以及「打印」「导出 PDF」「导出 PNG」按钮。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "工具列:「預覽 / 原始碼」切換、紙張規格說明,以及「列印」「匯出 PDF」「匯出 PNG」按鈕。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
